Package: rpartite
Title: Bipartite and Tripartite Graphs for Visualization of Relational Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Zjardyn", "Liera-Hood", , "zlieraho@uwaterloo.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides useful wrapper functions to create, colour, and
    modify bipartite and tripartite graphs using the 'igraph' package.
    This package focuses on data visualization and was created with
    biological data in mind. Useful for visualizing hierarchical
    relationships between variables, such as organism, gene, and function.
    Once a graph is created and modified to your liking, it can be
    visualized using the 'ggraph' package.
